Viktor 07.10.2026, from the road:

- «при наборе `[` появлялись как в кодовых IDE подсказки с выбором, Enter и вставка? Базовые в самом начале — Verse, Bridge,
  etc, но на особые Intro, Outro, END проверка, если уже есть в тексте»: heresy-complete.js. A «[» at a line's start in the
  Creator's or the Writer's lyrics opens the cheat-sheet's sections (heresy-instruments.js lyricTags()): Verse, Chorus,
  Pre-Chorus, Bridge, Interlude, Break, then Intro, Outro, End, then the rest as the official examples count them. Typed
  letters narrow it from a word's start, a Russian or Ukrainian layout too; a number numbers the tag; numbered verses are
  offered the next. ↑ ↓, Enter or Tab (the tag on its own line, the cursor under it, Ctrl+Z takes it back), Esc, «]»; Intro,
  Outro and End already there (his [END] too) last and dimmed with their line, a numbered tag there likewise. Ctrl+Space
  opens it, and at a line's start types the «[» itself.
- «игнорирование подсчётов, если в строке два [] тега типа [Break] [Silence]»; «Счёт по базису реальных вокальных секций.
  Даже если внутри паузные, интерлюдия/прелюдия, общее продолжаем по главному тегу секции»: heresy-lyrics.js. Every [tag] of
  a line is a tag: a line of tags alone counts as none, a tag inside a sung line is left out; a pause, break, silence,
  interlude, prelude or instrumental cue inside a sung section opens no group (its name dimmed beside it, the section's
  ruler goes on); a tag still being written is not counted.
- «Твоя подсветка работает при ровном скейле в 100%. На 110% уже съехала вниз»: not the zoom. The lifted frame's sticky
  Generate bar is 70 px and the frame's own box reaches under it; a match counted as seen down to 48 px above the frame's
  foot fell in 22 px under the bar (his 110 % put the line there): nothing scrolled, the mark stood on the bar (measured at
  100 % and 110 %, the profile's zoom level). Seen is asked of the page now (elementFromPoint), the browser scrolls a probe
  into the middle of every box on the way, a mark is drawn only on words seen. The stress marks' button likewise.
- «Если активен виджет поиска… встал курсором на другом месте, и единое движение клавишами… переносит оттуда на место
  поиска»: words typed in the box count the matches again quietly; Esc from the box closes the bar and leaves the cursor.
  And Esc in the find bar or the tags list in a lifted frame closes them, not the frame.
- «Расширь селектор солвера на две колонки, чтобы была симетрия»: the solver spans two columns while MP3's bitrate is
  hidden (two rows full); with MP3 the six fields fill two rows as they are.

Kitchen suite: 391 passed, 0 failed, 7 skipped.

